{"id":"vol8-05","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-05/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":544.25,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.22,"text":"Now turn to section 3 on page 5.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.34],["turn",0.34,0.62],["to",0.62,0.82],["section",0.82,1.06],["3",1.06,1.68],["on",1.68,2.24],["page",2.24,2.54],["5.",2.54,3.22]]},{"start":5.82,"end":6.6,"text":"Section 3.","words":[["Section",5.82,6.02],["3.",6.02,6.6]]},{"start":7.72,"end":16.4,"text":"You will hear a university lecturer talking to a female student called Katie and a male student called John about writing essays.","words":[["You",7.72,8.0],["will",8.0,8.14],["hear",8.14,8.36],["a",8.36,8.54],["university",8.54,9.08],["lecturer",9.08,9.68],["talking",9.68,10.28],["to",10.28,10.56],["a",10.56,10.74],["female",10.74,11.04],["student",11.04,11.66],["called",11.66,12.06],["Katie",12.06,12.44],["and",12.44,13.08],["a",13.08,13.24],["male",13.24,13.4],["student",13.4,13.88],["called",13.88,14.22],["John",14.22,14.68],["about",14.68,15.44],["writing",15.44,15.96],["essays.",15.96,16.4]]},{"start":17.5,"end":23.6,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 21 to 25 on page 5.","words":[["First",17.5,18.3],["you",18.3,18.52],["have",18.52,18.68],["some",18.68,18.84],["time",18.84,19.26],["to",19.26,19.5],["look",19.5,19.62],["at",19.62,19.76],["questions",19.76,20.06],["21",20.06,20.88],["to",20.88,21.14],["25",21.14,21.7],["on",21.7,22.68],["page",22.68,23.0],["5.",23.0,23.6]]},{"start":53.99,"end":58.15,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 25.","words":[["Now",53.99,54.35],["listen",54.35,54.73],["carefully",54.73,55.19],["and",55.19,55.59],["answer",55.59,55.97],["questions",55.97,56.39],["21",56.39,57.27],["to",57.27,57.55],["25.",57.55,58.15]]},{"start":61.63,"end":67.35,"text":"Morning, Katie. Morning, John. I want to talk about essays today and what the requirements","words":[["Morning,",61.63,62.11],["Katie.",62.25,62.45],["Morning,",62.81,62.99],["John.",63.05,63.27],["I",64.01,64.25],["want",64.25,64.45],["to",64.45,64.57],["talk",64.57,64.77],["about",64.77,64.99],["essays",64.99,65.49],["today",65.49,65.87],["and",65.87,66.59],["what",66.59,66.79],["the",66.79,66.93],["requirements",66.93,67.35]]},{"start":67.35,"end":72.15,"text":"are for this university. What kinds of things we look for when we're grading them, okay?","words":[["are",67.35,67.73],["for",67.73,67.89],["this",67.89,68.07],["university.",68.07,68.57],["What",69.21,69.37],["kinds",69.37,69.69],["of",69.69,69.83],["things",69.83,70.01],["we",70.01,70.25],["look",70.25,70.47],["for",70.47,70.79],["when",70.79,70.97],["we're",70.97,71.17],["grading",71.17,71.41],["them,",71.41,71.63],["okay?",71.89,72.15]]},{"start":73.19,"end":78.59,"text":"So let's look at those two sample essays I gave you last week. I asked you to read them","words":[["So",73.19,73.67],["let's",73.67,74.15],["look",74.15,74.29],["at",74.29,74.41],["those",74.41,74.61],["two",74.61,74.81],["sample",74.81,75.25],["essays",75.25,75.67],["I",75.67,75.91],["gave",75.91,76.07],["you",76.07,76.21],["last",76.21,76.43],["week.",76.43,76.69],["I",77.53,77.63],["asked",77.63,77.89],["you",77.89,78.01],["to",78.01,78.11],["read",78.11,78.33],["them",78.33,78.59]]},{"start":78.59,"end":83.61,"text":"and to think about their strong and weak points. Do either of you have any general","words":[["and",78.59,78.95],["to",78.95,79.11],["think",79.11,79.25],["about",79.25,79.47],["their",79.47,79.75],["strong",79.75,80.23],["and",80.23,80.61],["weak",80.61,80.89],["points.",80.89,81.29],["Do",81.83,82.21],["either",82.21,82.45],["of",82.45,82.59],["you",82.59,82.67],["have",82.67,82.91],["any",82.91,83.17],["general",83.17,83.61]]},{"start":83.61,"end":86.69,"text":"comments or questions about the first one? Katie?","words":[["comments",83.61,84.05],["or",84.05,84.27],["questions",84.27,84.65],["about",84.65,84.91],["the",84.91,85.11],["first",85.11,85.33],["one?",85.33,85.55],["Katie?",86.39,86.69]]},{"start":87.35,"end":94.17,"text":"Well, the writer's made it quite clear what his own views are about this subject, but","words":[["Well,",87.35,87.95],["the",88.87,89.11],["writer's",89.11,89.69],["made",89.69,89.91],["it",89.91,90.07],["quite",90.07,90.45],["clear",90.45,90.91],["what",90.91,91.19],["his",91.19,91.39],["own",91.39,91.69],["views",91.69,92.03],["are",92.03,92.33],["about",92.33,92.65],["this",92.65,92.91],["subject,",92.91,93.31],["but",93.77,94.17]]},{"start":94.17,"end":98.09,"text":"I thought in academic essays you weren't supposed to do that.","words":[["I",94.17,94.63],["thought",94.63,94.91],["in",94.91,95.31],["academic",95.31,95.75],["essays",95.75,96.21],["you",96.21,96.53],["weren't",96.53,96.91],["supposed",96.91,97.25],["to",97.25,97.65],["do",97.65,97.83],["that.",97.83,98.09]]},{"start":98.69,"end":102.89,"text":"I thought you were meant to present all the different arguments and just appear to be","words":[["I",98.69,98.99],["thought",98.99,99.19],["you",99.19,99.35],["were",99.35,99.45],["meant",99.45,99.61],["to",99.61,99.87],["present",99.87,100.19],["all",100.19,100.61],["the",100.61,100.73],["different",100.73,100.97],["arguments",100.97,101.37],["and",101.37,101.87],["just",101.87,102.11],["appear",102.11,102.55],["to",102.55,102.75],["be",102.75,102.89]]},{"start":102.89,"end":105.15,"text":"neutral about which one you think is best.","words":[["neutral",102.89,103.37],["about",103.37,103.69],["which",103.69,104.17],["one",104.17,104.41],["you",104.41,104.55],["think",104.55,104.71],["is",104.71,104.85],["best.",104.85,105.15]]},{"start":105.91,"end":111.39,"text":"Students do sometimes come down quite firmly on one particular side, and that's OK as","words":[["Students",105.91,106.33],["do",106.33,106.61],["sometimes",106.61,107.03],["come",107.03,107.41],["down",107.41,107.63],["quite",107.63,107.91],["firmly",107.91,108.31],["on",108.31,108.55],["one",108.55,108.75],["particular",108.75,109.19],["side,",109.19,109.73],["and",110.07,110.33],["that's",110.33,110.61],["OK",110.61,110.99],["as",110.99,111.39]]},{"start":111.39,"end":115.23,"text":"long as they can show that they've given balanced consideration to all the issues.","words":[["long",111.39,111.55],["as",111.55,111.67],["they",111.67,111.79],["can",111.79,111.93],["show",111.93,112.23],["that",112.23,112.39],["they've",112.39,112.61],["given",112.61,112.81],["balanced",112.81,113.39],["consideration",113.39,114.03],["to",114.03,114.49],["all",114.49,114.73],["the",114.73,114.89],["issues.",114.89,115.23]]},{"start":115.23,"end":120.35,"text":"views. Do you see what I mean? John, you're looking a bit uncertain. Did you want to say","words":[["views.",115.23,115.35],["Do",115.81,115.97],["you",115.97,116.01],["see",116.01,116.09],["what",116.09,116.19],["I",116.19,116.27],["mean?",116.27,116.43],["John,",117.49,117.77],["you're",118.07,118.21],["looking",118.21,118.45],["a",118.45,118.61],["bit",118.61,118.67],["uncertain.",118.67,118.97],["Did",119.67,119.89],["you",119.89,120.01],["want",120.01,120.13],["to",120.13,120.21],["say",120.21,120.35]]},{"start":120.35,"end":120.61,"text":"something?","words":[["something?",120.35,120.61]]},{"start":121.15,"end":125.01,"text":"Well, what if you don't feel as sure about the debate as this student?","words":[["Well,",121.15,121.37],["what",121.79,122.13],["if",122.13,122.27],["you",122.27,122.39],["don't",122.39,122.53],["feel",122.53,122.77],["as",122.77,122.95],["sure",122.95,123.31],["about",123.31,123.59],["the",123.59,123.81],["debate",123.81,124.11],["as",124.11,124.41],["this",124.41,124.61],["student?",124.61,125.01]]},{"start":125.59,"end":128.89,"text":"There's another type of conclusion that's valid when you're writing at this level.","words":[["There's",125.59,126.03],["another",126.03,126.27],["type",126.27,126.51],["of",126.51,126.67],["conclusion",126.67,127.01],["that's",127.01,127.43],["valid",127.43,127.69],["when",127.69,127.93],["you're",127.93,128.09],["writing",128.09,128.33],["at",128.33,128.49],["this",128.49,128.65],["level.",128.65,128.89]]},{"start":129.53,"end":134.23,"text":"People don't have to come down strongly on a particular side. They can say in the essay","words":[["People",129.53,129.77],["don't",129.77,130.11],["have",130.11,130.27],["to",130.27,130.41],["come",130.41,130.61],["down",130.61,130.79],["strongly",130.79,131.25],["on",131.25,131.51],["a",131.51,131.61],["particular",131.61,131.91],["side.",131.91,132.49],["They",133.07,133.25],["can",133.25,133.51],["say",133.51,133.79],["in",133.79,133.93],["the",133.93,134.01],["essay",134.01,134.23]]},{"start":134.23,"end":139.53,"text":"that the process of researching a particular topic has identified the importance of a range","words":[["that",134.23,134.57],["the",134.57,134.75],["process",134.75,135.15],["of",135.15,135.47],["researching",135.47,135.95],["a",135.95,136.15],["particular",136.15,136.49],["topic",136.49,136.97],["has",136.97,137.35],["identified",137.35,137.97],["the",137.97,138.29],["importance",138.29,138.75],["of",138.75,139.15],["a",139.15,139.27],["range",139.27,139.53]]},{"start":139.53,"end":144.65,"text":"of studies that support different viewpoints, and then they return to the title of the assignment.","words":[["of",139.53,139.71],["studies",139.71,140.01],["that",140.01,140.41],["support",140.41,140.83],["different",140.83,141.27],["viewpoints,",141.27,141.79],["and",142.13,142.59],["then",142.59,142.87],["they",142.87,143.03],["return",143.03,143.37],["to",143.37,143.57],["the",143.57,143.69],["title",143.69,144.03],["of",144.03,144.21],["the",144.21,144.31],["assignment.",144.31,144.65]]},{"start":145.33,"end":151.05,"text":"And I'd say that it's a good idea to use some of the actual words that are in the title.","words":[["And",145.33,145.61],["I'd",145.61,147.33],["say",147.33,147.55],["that",147.55,147.79],["it's",147.79,147.93],["a",147.93,148.03],["good",148.03,148.19],["idea",148.19,148.51],["to",148.51,148.67],["use",148.67,148.85],["some",148.85,149.05],["of",149.05,149.15],["the",149.15,149.27],["actual",149.27,149.65],["words",149.65,150.21],["that",150.21,150.41],["are",150.41,150.53],["in",150.53,150.65],["the",150.65,150.73],["title.",150.73,151.05]]},{"start":151.59,"end":154.37,"text":"It shows the reader that you're still on track. Okay?","words":[["It",151.59,151.71],["shows",151.71,151.95],["the",151.95,152.19],["reader",152.19,152.41],["that",152.41,152.61],["you're",152.61,152.81],["still",152.81,153.03],["on",153.03,153.21],["track.",153.21,153.51],["Okay?",154.21,154.37]]},{"start":155.31,"end":160.35,"text":"Tony, can I just ask you something about the bibliography?","words":[["Tony,",155.31,155.83],["can",157.43,157.81],["I",157.81,158.11],["just",158.11,158.37],["ask",158.37,158.73],["you",158.73,158.89],["something",158.89,159.19],["about",159.19,159.57],["the",159.57,159.73],["bibliography?",159.73,160.35]]},{"start":160.91,"end":161.21,"text":"Of course.","words":[["Of",160.91,160.97],["course.",160.97,161.21]]},{"start":162.53,"end":167.55,"text":"This person's used italics when he refers to book titles in the reference section,","words":[["This",162.53,163.05],["person's",163.05,163.57],["used",163.57,163.77],["italics",163.77,164.51],["when",164.51,164.77],["he",164.77,164.91],["refers",164.91,165.27],["to",165.27,165.49],["book",165.49,165.73],["titles",165.73,166.11],["in",166.11,166.51],["the",166.51,166.69],["reference",166.69,166.97],["section,",166.97,167.55]]},{"start":167.55,"end":170.25,"text":"but I thought we had to underline them.","words":[["but",167.55,167.91],["I",167.91,168.73],["thought",168.73,168.97],["we",168.97,169.17],["had",169.17,169.35],["to",169.35,169.51],["underline",169.51,169.97],["them.",169.97,170.25]]},{"start":170.93,"end":174.57,"text":"Actually, he's done it in the way we set out in the university study guide.","words":[["Actually,",170.93,171.35],["he's",171.49,171.73],["done",171.73,171.87],["it",171.87,172.01],["in",172.01,172.07],["the",172.07,172.17],["way",172.17,172.35],["we",172.35,172.59],["set",172.59,172.85],["out",172.85,173.05],["in",173.05,173.21],["the",173.21,173.31],["university",173.31,173.75],["study",173.75,174.19],["guide.",174.19,174.57]]},{"start":175.09,"end":177.29,"text":"That is the appropriate convention for titles.","words":[["That",175.09,175.33],["is",175.33,175.47],["the",175.47,175.59],["appropriate",175.59,176.03],["convention",176.03,176.69],["for",176.69,176.97],["titles.",176.97,177.29]]},{"start":178.29,"end":181.85,"text":"You might think it's trivial, but presenting references appropriately","words":[["You",178.29,178.57],["might",178.57,178.79],["think",178.79,179.01],["it's",179.01,179.21],["trivial,",179.21,179.57],["but",179.97,180.13],["presenting",180.13,180.59],["references",180.59,181.23],["appropriately",181.23,181.85]]},{"start":181.85,"end":184.89,"text":"is one of the requirements of a degree at this level,","words":[["is",181.85,182.59],["one",182.59,182.83],["of",182.83,182.95],["the",182.95,183.07],["requirements",183.07,183.63],["of",183.63,183.87],["a",183.87,183.95],["degree",183.95,184.23],["at",184.23,184.41],["this",184.41,184.57],["level,",184.57,184.89]]},{"start":184.91,"end":188.19,"text":"so I wouldn't be doing my job properly if I didn't stress that.","words":[["so",184.91,185.17],["I",185.17,185.69],["wouldn't",185.69,185.95],["be",185.95,186.09],["doing",186.09,186.23],["my",186.23,186.39],["job",186.39,186.61],["properly",186.61,187.01],["if",187.01,187.19],["I",187.19,187.31],["didn't",187.31,187.51],["stress",187.51,187.89],["that.",187.89,188.19]]},{"start":188.93,"end":192.41,"text":"And once people are used to it, they don't generally have a big problem with it.","words":[["And",188.93,189.41],["once",189.41,189.65],["people",189.65,189.89],["are",189.89,190.01],["used",190.01,190.21],["to",190.21,190.35],["it,",190.35,190.45],["they",190.49,190.57],["don't",190.57,190.79],["generally",190.79,191.17],["have",191.17,191.43],["a",191.43,191.53],["big",191.53,191.69],["problem",191.69,192.03],["with",192.03,192.23],["it.",192.23,192.41]]},{"start":193.33,"end":194.07,"text":"Yes, Katie?","words":[["Yes,",193.33,193.81],["Katie?",193.93,194.07]]},{"start":194.07,"end":200.43,"text":"You mentioned the university study guide. I looked in there to see what it said about","words":[["You",194.07,195.01],["mentioned",195.01,195.47],["the",195.47,195.73],["university",195.73,196.29],["study",196.29,196.91],["guide.",196.91,197.29],["I",197.87,198.25],["looked",198.25,198.55],["in",198.55,198.79],["there",198.79,199.03],["to",199.03,199.21],["see",199.21,199.43],["what",199.43,199.69],["it",199.69,199.95],["said",199.95,200.15],["about",200.15,200.43]]},{"start":200.43,"end":207.69,"text":"quotations. The essay's got a lot of quite long ones and I was a bit surprised by that.","words":[["quotations.",200.43,201.13],["The",202.09,202.63],["essay's",202.63,203.11],["got",203.11,203.31],["a",203.31,203.53],["lot",203.53,203.79],["of",203.79,203.93],["quite",203.93,204.25],["long",204.25,204.61],["ones",204.61,205.01],["and",205.01,205.81],["I",205.81,206.31],["was",206.31,206.45],["a",206.45,206.57],["bit",206.57,206.71],["surprised",206.71,207.15],["by",207.15,207.47],["that.",207.47,207.69]]},{"start":208.17,"end":209.99,"text":"I thought we weren't supposed to do that.","words":[["I",208.17,208.39],["thought",208.39,208.61],["we",208.61,208.81],["weren't",208.81,209.03],["supposed",209.03,209.19],["to",209.19,209.53],["do",209.53,209.69],["that.",209.69,209.99]]},{"start":210.29,"end":214.53,"text":"But using a range of quotations is a way of showing that you have actually read quite","words":[["But",210.29,210.45],["using",210.45,210.71],["a",210.71,210.91],["range",210.91,211.21],["of",211.21,211.37],["quotations",211.37,212.13],["is",212.13,212.59],["a",212.59,212.71],["way",212.71,212.83],["of",212.83,212.95],["showing",212.95,213.23],["that",213.23,213.51],["you",213.51,213.65],["have",213.65,213.77],["actually",213.77,214.03],["read",214.03,214.29],["quite",214.29,214.53]]},{"start":214.53,"end":215.71,"text":"widely, isn't it?","words":[["widely,",214.53,215.09],["isn't",215.27,215.47],["it?",215.47,215.71]]},{"start":216.17,"end":222.33,"text":"Well, not really. Unfortunately some students just pick out extracts to quote without actually","words":[["Well,",216.17,216.47],["not",216.73,216.99],["really.",216.99,217.37],["Unfortunately",218.07,218.61],["some",218.61,219.01],["students",219.01,219.43],["just",219.43,219.71],["pick",219.71,219.97],["out",219.97,220.17],["extracts",220.17,221.01],["to",221.01,221.13],["quote",221.13,221.45],["without",221.45,221.79],["actually",221.79,222.33]]},{"start":222.33,"end":228.51,"text":"reading the whole thing. It's really a matter of using quotations appropriately. I've marked","words":[["reading",222.33,222.63],["the",222.63,222.85],["whole",222.85,223.03],["thing.",223.03,223.33],["It's",223.87,224.47],["really",224.47,224.81],["a",224.81,224.93],["matter",224.93,225.13],["of",225.13,225.29],["using",225.29,225.57],["quotations",225.57,226.31],["appropriately.",226.31,227.05],["I've",228.03,228.33],["marked",228.33,228.51]]},{"start":228.51,"end":233.25,"text":"essays in the past where literally every fourth or fifth sentence has been a quote and that","words":[["essays",228.51,228.75],["in",228.75,228.93],["the",228.93,229.01],["past",229.01,229.27],["where",229.27,229.51],["literally",229.51,229.83],["every",229.83,230.17],["fourth",230.17,230.63],["or",230.63,230.85],["fifth",230.85,231.15],["sentence",231.15,231.59],["has",231.59,231.93],["been",231.93,232.09],["a",232.09,232.21],["quote",232.21,232.39],["and",232.39,233.09],["that",233.09,233.25]]},{"start":233.25,"end":238.69,"text":"definitely isn't acceptable. You have to read widely but you should be assimilating","words":[["definitely",233.25,233.85],["isn't",233.85,234.35],["acceptable.",234.35,234.87],["You",235.43,235.83],["have",235.83,236.01],["to",236.01,236.15],["read",236.15,236.39],["widely",236.39,236.95],["but",236.95,237.47],["you",237.47,237.61],["should",237.61,237.81],["be",237.81,237.99],["assimilating",237.99,238.69]]},{"start":238.69,"end":242.59,"text":"what you've read and in general presenting the ideas in your own words.","words":[["what",238.69,238.93],["you've",238.93,239.15],["read",239.15,239.33],["and",239.33,239.83],["in",239.83,240.05],["general",240.05,240.41],["presenting",240.41,240.95],["the",240.95,241.23],["ideas",241.23,241.63],["in",241.63,241.97],["your",241.97,242.11],["own",242.11,242.23],["words.",242.23,242.59]]},{"start":242.97,"end":245.53,"text":"So when exactly should we use quotes?","words":[["So",242.97,243.31],["when",243.31,243.83],["exactly",243.83,244.23],["should",244.23,244.67],["we",244.67,244.93],["use",244.93,245.23],["quotes?",245.23,245.53]]},{"start":246.25,"end":251.31,"text":"Particularly where there are definitions involved as there are here. Generally speaking","words":[["Particularly",246.25,246.73],["where",246.73,247.21],["there",247.21,247.39],["are",247.39,247.49],["definitions",247.49,247.85],["involved",247.85,248.51],["as",248.51,248.97],["there",248.97,249.13],["are",249.13,249.27],["here.",249.27,249.53],["Generally",250.35,250.87],["speaking",250.87,251.31]]},{"start":251.31,"end":256.55,"text":"I'd say that you need to be aware of words within the essay title itself that are possibly","words":[["I'd",251.31,252.15],["say",252.15,252.33],["that",252.33,252.47],["you",252.47,252.61],["need",252.61,252.77],["to",252.77,252.89],["be",252.89,252.97],["aware",252.97,253.27],["of",253.27,253.49],["words",253.49,253.87],["within",253.87,254.21],["the",254.21,254.37],["essay",254.37,254.63],["title",254.63,255.09],["itself",255.09,255.49],["that",255.49,255.83],["are",255.83,256.03],["possibly",256.03,256.55]]},{"start":256.55,"end":259.19,"text":"contentious terms that need defining.","words":[["contentious",256.55,257.61],["terms",257.61,258.01],["that",258.01,258.27],["need",258.27,258.69],["defining.",258.69,259.19]]},{"start":259.97,"end":262.91,"text":"For instance, this one here has the word culture in it.","words":[["For",259.97,260.25],["instance,",260.25,260.43],["this",260.67,260.97],["one",260.97,261.15],["here",261.15,261.37],["has",261.37,261.61],["the",261.61,261.75],["word",261.75,261.95],["culture",261.95,262.51],["in",262.51,262.75],["it.",262.75,262.91]]},{"start":263.49,"end":268.15,"text":"Now, although you probably have a rough idea of what that term means, you might not be","words":[["Now,",263.49,263.67],["although",263.81,264.25],["you",264.25,264.47],["probably",264.47,264.79],["have",264.79,265.09],["a",265.09,265.19],["rough",265.19,265.43],["idea",265.43,265.79],["of",265.79,265.97],["what",265.97,266.11],["that",266.11,266.31],["term",266.31,266.55],["means,",266.55,266.97],["you",267.35,267.59],["might",267.59,267.81],["not",267.81,267.97],["be",267.97,268.15]]},{"start":268.15,"end":269.69,"text":"able to articulate it very well.","words":[["able",268.15,268.33],["to",268.33,268.47],["articulate",268.47,268.93],["it",268.93,269.21],["very",269.21,269.39],["well.",269.39,269.69]]},{"start":270.39,"end":274.65,"text":"So why not cite someone else's definition rather than dream one up yourself?","words":[["So",270.39,270.61],["why",270.61,271.03],["not",271.03,271.17],["cite",271.17,271.55],["someone",271.55,271.95],["else's",271.95,272.35],["definition",272.35,272.81],["rather",272.81,273.29],["than",273.29,273.61],["dream",273.61,273.89],["one",273.89,274.11],["up",274.11,274.29],["yourself?",274.29,274.65]]},{"start":275.57,"end":278.75,"text":"Okay, any other comments on this first essay?","words":[["Okay,",275.57,276.13],["any",276.71,277.03],["other",277.03,277.23],["comments",277.23,277.65],["on",277.65,277.85],["this",277.85,278.01],["first",278.01,278.37],["essay?",278.37,278.75]]},{"start":278.75,"end":282.47,"text":"What about the way the writer discusses research findings?","words":[["What",278.75,279.61],["about",279.61,279.79],["the",279.79,280.15],["way",280.15,280.29],["the",280.29,280.47],["writer",280.47,280.73],["discusses",280.73,281.65],["research",281.65,282.09],["findings?",282.09,282.47]]},{"start":282.97,"end":287.77,"text":"One thing that struck me was the approach of the student to some of the things he'd read.","words":[["One",282.97,283.51],["thing",283.51,283.79],["that",283.79,283.95],["struck",283.95,284.19],["me",284.19,284.55],["was",284.55,284.85],["the",284.85,285.01],["approach",285.01,285.35],["of",285.35,285.59],["the",285.59,285.73],["student",285.73,286.11],["to",286.11,286.39],["some",286.39,286.63],["of",286.63,286.75],["the",286.75,286.89],["things",286.89,287.11],["he'd",287.11,287.41],["read.",287.41,287.77]]},{"start":288.35,"end":293.59,"text":"He says things like, we aren't given enough evidence or we don't know how he got his results.","words":[["He",288.35,288.61],["says",288.61,288.79],["things",288.79,289.03],["like,",289.03,289.29],["we",289.65,289.73],["aren't",289.73,290.05],["given",290.05,290.31],["enough",290.31,290.61],["evidence",290.61,291.11],["or",291.11,291.57],["we",291.57,291.93],["don't",291.93,292.17],["know",292.17,292.35],["how",292.35,292.61],["he",292.61,292.77],["got",292.77,292.95],["his",292.95,293.15],["results.",293.15,293.59]]},{"start":294.43,"end":300.43,"text":"When you're reading about someone's research at second hand, you often don't get told how many people were studied","words":[["When",294.43,294.75],["you're",294.75,294.95],["reading",294.95,295.13],["about",295.13,295.41],["someone's",295.41,295.91],["research",295.91,296.33],["at",296.33,296.51],["second",296.51,296.79],["hand,",296.79,297.17],["you",297.39,297.53],["often",297.53,297.73],["don't",297.73,298.29],["get",298.29,298.47],["told",298.47,298.93],["how",298.93,299.19],["many",299.19,299.35],["people",299.35,299.71],["were",299.71,299.91],["studied",299.91,300.43]]},{"start":300.43,"end":306.05,"text":"or exactly what kind of questionnaires were used or how exactly the results were analysed.","words":[["or",300.43,300.91],["exactly",300.91,301.23],["what",301.23,301.49],["kind",301.49,301.71],["of",301.71,301.85],["questionnaires",301.85,302.63],["were",302.63,302.85],["used",302.85,303.27],["or",303.27,303.71],["how",303.71,303.93],["exactly",303.93,304.39],["the",304.39,304.59],["results",304.59,304.99],["were",304.99,305.19],["analysed.",305.19,306.05]]},{"start":306.05,"end":310.89,"text":"But I've always felt that it's just up to me to go to the primary sources and find out.","words":[["But",306.05,306.59],["I've",306.59,306.87],["always",306.87,307.01],["felt",307.01,307.29],["that",307.29,307.53],["it's",307.53,307.81],["just",307.81,307.99],["up",307.99,308.19],["to",308.19,308.33],["me",308.33,308.53],["to",308.53,308.71],["go",308.71,308.87],["to",308.87,309.01],["the",309.01,309.13],["primary",309.13,309.45],["sources",309.45,309.89],["and",309.89,310.29],["find",310.29,310.57],["out.",310.57,310.89]]},{"start":311.31,"end":317.13,"text":"It is important that you feel free to say if there are reasons why you can't make a clear judgment about something.","words":[["It",311.31,311.77],["is",311.77,311.97],["important",311.97,312.37],["that",312.37,312.61],["you",312.61,312.69],["feel",312.69,312.95],["free",312.95,313.23],["to",313.23,313.41],["say",313.41,313.71],["if",313.71,313.99],["there",313.99,314.17],["are",314.17,314.37],["reasons",314.37,314.81],["why",314.81,315.23],["you",315.23,315.41],["can't",315.41,315.65],["make",315.65,315.77],["a",315.77,315.91],["clear",315.91,316.15],["judgment",316.15,316.47],["about",316.47,316.75],["something.",316.75,317.13]]},{"start":317.65,"end":319.81,"text":"But you don't have to, not at this level.","words":[["But",317.65,317.97],["you",317.97,318.27],["don't",318.27,318.45],["have",318.45,318.73],["to,",318.73,318.95],["not",319.13,319.27],["at",319.27,319.39],["this",319.39,319.55],["level.",319.55,319.81]]},{"start":320.49,"end":323.77,"text":"It's almost as if we just take things for granted, okay?","words":[["It's",320.49,320.71],["almost",320.71,320.87],["as",320.87,321.17],["if",321.17,321.31],["we",321.31,321.47],["just",321.47,321.69],["take",321.69,322.05],["things",322.05,322.31],["for",322.31,322.49],["granted,",322.49,322.87],["okay?",323.47,323.77]]},{"start":327.52,"end":335.1,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 26 to 30 on page 6.","words":[["Before",327.52,327.98],["you",327.98,328.24],["hear",328.24,328.48],["the",328.48,328.7],["rest",328.7,328.94],["of",328.94,329.1],["the",329.1,329.16],["discussion,",329.16,329.6],["you",329.92,330.32],["have",330.32,330.54],["some",330.54,330.74],["time",330.74,331.18],["to",331.18,331.48],["look",331.48,331.62],["at",331.62,331.76],["questions",331.76,332.08],["26",332.08,333.02],["to",333.02,333.22],["30",333.22,333.56],["on",333.56,334.24],["page",334.24,334.54],["6.",334.54,335.1]]},{"start":335.1,"end":368.86,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 26 to 30.","words":[["Now",335.1,335.9],["listen",365.86,366.22],["and",366.22,366.68],["answer",366.68,367.08],["questions",367.08,367.5],["26",367.5,368.36],["to",368.36,368.58],["30.",368.58,368.86]]},{"start":372.46,"end":374.92,"text":"Now let's look at the second essay then.","words":[["Now",372.46,373.02],["let's",373.02,373.58],["look",373.58,373.76],["at",373.76,373.88],["the",373.88,373.98],["second",373.98,374.34],["essay",374.34,374.64],["then.",374.64,374.92]]},{"start":375.68,"end":379.34,"text":"First of all, this essay title is in the form of a question, isn't it?","words":[["First",375.68,376.24],["of",376.24,376.42],["all,",376.42,376.62],["this",376.8,376.94],["essay",376.94,377.34],["title",377.34,377.7],["is",377.7,378.04],["in",378.04,378.14],["the",378.14,378.24],["form",378.24,378.42],["of",378.42,378.56],["a",378.56,378.62],["question,",378.62,378.9],["isn't",379.0,379.12],["it?",379.12,379.34]]},{"start":380.14,"end":382.06,"text":"Did you think this student answered the question?","words":[["Did",380.14,380.3],["you",380.3,380.44],["think",380.44,380.64],["this",380.64,380.84],["student",380.84,381.18],["answered",381.18,381.62],["the",381.62,381.78],["question?",381.78,382.06]]},{"start":382.72,"end":383.28,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",382.72,383.28]]},{"start":384.1,"end":384.36,"text":"Good.","words":[["Good.",384.1,384.36]]},{"start":384.74,"end":386.4,"text":"Because, really, that's the bottom line.","words":[["Because,",384.74,385.02],["really,",385.18,385.44],["that's",385.58,385.8],["the",385.8,385.92],["bottom",385.92,386.1],["line.",386.1,386.4]]},{"start":387.08,"end":391.04,"text":"The minimum criterion for an assignment is relevance, yes?","words":[["The",387.08,387.16],["minimum",387.16,387.44],["criterion",387.44,388.08],["for",388.08,388.5],["an",388.5,388.6],["assignment",388.6,388.94],["is",388.94,389.42],["relevance,",389.42,389.9],["yes?",390.4,391.04]]},{"start":392.22,"end":397.36,"text":"Sometimes people don't seem to see the words on the page, but you have to be very focused","words":[["Sometimes",392.22,392.78],["people",392.78,393.34],["don't",393.34,393.62],["seem",393.62,393.88],["to",393.88,394.04],["see",394.04,394.26],["the",394.26,394.42],["words",394.42,394.66],["on",394.66,394.8],["the",394.8,394.9],["page,",394.9,395.34],["but",395.34,396.0],["you",396.0,396.12],["have",396.12,396.28],["to",396.28,396.38],["be",396.38,396.52],["very",396.52,396.8],["focused",396.8,397.36]]},{"start":398.04,"end":403.54,"text":"Secondly, what about the overall structure? Would you say that the essay is well structured?","words":[["Secondly,",398.04,398.64],["what",398.98,399.3],["about",399.3,399.5],["the",399.5,399.8],["overall",399.8,400.38],["structure?",400.38,400.92],["Would",401.68,401.8],["you",401.8,401.96],["say",401.96,402.2],["that",402.2,402.38],["the",402.38,402.5],["essay",402.5,402.76],["is",402.76,402.98],["well",402.98,403.14],["structured?",403.14,403.54]]},{"start":404.74,"end":412.44,"text":"Yes, I would. I mean, sometimes writers mix different subtopics up, so it's quite difficult","words":[["Yes,",404.74,405.34],["I",405.64,405.8],["would.",405.8,406.08],["I",406.8,407.02],["mean,",407.02,407.3],["sometimes",407.76,408.16],["writers",408.16,408.72],["mix",408.72,409.18],["different",409.18,409.6],["subtopics",409.6,410.32],["up,",410.32,410.7],["so",411.02,411.44],["it's",411.44,411.92],["quite",411.92,412.06],["difficult",412.06,412.44]]},{"start":412.44,"end":417.26,"text":"to follow the logic of the essay, but here I think they're separated very clearly.","words":[["to",412.44,412.68],["follow",412.68,412.88],["the",412.88,413.04],["logic",413.04,413.34],["of",413.34,413.54],["the",413.54,413.66],["essay,",413.66,414.02],["but",414.38,414.7],["here",414.7,415.26],["I",415.26,415.5],["think",415.5,415.74],["they're",415.74,416.12],["separated",416.12,416.58],["very",416.58,416.88],["clearly.",416.88,417.26]]},{"start":418.16,"end":418.98,"text":"Do you agree, John?","words":[["Do",418.16,418.46],["you",418.46,418.6],["agree,",418.6,418.82],["John?",418.9,418.98]]},{"start":419.6,"end":426.04,"text":"Yes. I mean, it is very clear. But is it okay to use subheadings and bullet points","words":[["Yes.",419.6,420.2],["I",420.9,421.1],["mean,",421.1,421.26],["it",421.62,421.76],["is",421.76,421.9],["very",421.9,422.12],["clear.",422.12,422.58],["But",423.16,423.34],["is",423.34,423.46],["it",423.46,423.58],["okay",423.58,423.86],["to",423.86,424.24],["use",424.24,424.48],["subheadings",424.48,425.22],["and",425.22,425.46],["bullet",425.46,425.7],["points",425.7,426.04]]},{"start":426.04,"end":432.18,"text":"like this. I mean, in things like reports they can be very useful, I know, but is it all right to","words":[["like",426.04,426.3],["this.",426.3,426.6],["I",427.14,427.22],["mean,",427.22,427.4],["in",427.78,428.1],["things",428.1,428.28],["like",428.28,428.5],["reports",428.5,429.02],["they",429.02,429.42],["can",429.42,429.56],["be",429.56,429.66],["very",429.66,429.84],["useful,",429.84,430.3],["I",430.44,430.54],["know,",430.54,430.7],["but",431.0,431.28],["is",431.28,431.56],["it",431.56,431.68],["all",431.68,431.86],["right",431.86,432.0],["to",432.0,432.18]]},{"start":432.18,"end":438.14,"text":"use them in academic essays? Well, my general feeling is that it's best just to use paragraphs to","words":[["use",432.18,432.38],["them",432.38,432.54],["in",432.54,432.66],["academic",432.66,433.08],["essays?",433.08,433.42],["Well,",434.3,434.6],["my",434.8,435.06],["general",435.06,435.4],["feeling",435.4,435.84],["is",435.84,436.18],["that",436.18,436.32],["it's",436.32,436.5],["best",436.5,436.68],["just",436.68,436.96],["to",436.96,437.14],["use",437.14,437.3],["paragraphs",437.3,437.76],["to",437.76,438.14]]},{"start":438.14,"end":442.9,"text":"signal changes of topic. The beginning of a paragraph should signal what you're going to say","words":[["signal",438.14,438.4],["changes",438.4,438.82],["of",438.82,439.0],["topic.",439.0,439.34],["The",440.12,440.32],["beginning",440.32,440.6],["of",440.6,440.78],["a",440.78,440.86],["paragraph",440.86,441.2],["should",441.2,441.5],["signal",441.5,441.88],["what",441.88,442.22],["you're",442.22,442.4],["going",442.4,442.54],["to",442.54,442.66],["say",442.66,442.9]]},{"start":442.9,"end":447.74,"text":"in general, and then as you get to the end of the paragraph, you should be signalling what","words":[["in",442.9,443.22],["general,",443.22,443.6],["and",443.78,444.24],["then",444.24,444.44],["as",444.44,444.74],["you",444.74,444.84],["get",444.84,444.94],["to",444.94,445.06],["the",445.06,445.16],["end",445.16,445.34],["of",445.34,445.42],["the",445.42,445.52],["paragraph,",445.52,445.98],["you",446.36,446.62],["should",446.62,446.8],["be",446.8,446.98],["signalling",446.98,447.46],["what",447.46,447.74]]},{"start":447.74,"end":452.42,"text":"you're going to move on to next. One thing I thought was really good about this essay","words":[["you're",447.74,447.9],["going",447.9,448.04],["to",448.04,448.16],["move",448.16,448.32],["on",448.32,448.48],["to",448.48,448.6],["next.",448.6,449.0],["One",449.72,450.16],["thing",450.16,450.38],["I",450.38,450.54],["thought",450.54,450.78],["was",450.78,451.0],["really",451.0,451.22],["good",451.22,451.5],["about",451.5,451.76],["this",451.76,452.04],["essay",452.04,452.42]]},{"start":452.42,"end":455.98,"text":"was the way the writer always gives examples to support statements.","words":[["was",452.42,452.78],["the",452.78,452.96],["way",452.96,453.12],["the",453.12,453.3],["writer",453.3,453.52],["always",453.52,453.92],["gives",453.92,454.18],["examples",454.18,454.82],["to",454.82,455.12],["support",455.12,455.5],["statements.",455.5,455.98]]},{"start":456.64,"end":459.34,"text":"He never just assumes that explanations are enough.","words":[["He",456.64,456.94],["never",456.94,457.12],["just",457.12,457.32],["assumes",457.32,457.88],["that",457.88,458.12],["explanations",458.12,458.64],["are",458.64,459.08],["enough.",459.08,459.34]]},{"start":459.76,"end":462.5,"text":"Yes, I'm glad you brought that up. I was going to mention it myself.","words":[["Yes,",459.76,460.02],["I'm",460.3,460.44],["glad",460.44,460.6],["you",460.6,460.76],["brought",460.76,460.9],["that",460.9,461.06],["up.",461.06,461.24],["I",461.44,461.52],["was",461.52,461.58],["going",461.58,461.68],["to",461.68,461.74],["mention",461.74,461.98],["it",461.98,462.1],["myself.",462.1,462.5]]},{"start":463.0,"end":465.26,"text":"As you say, it's very helpful for the reader.","words":[["As",463.0,463.2],["you",463.2,463.32],["say,",463.32,463.6],["it's",463.74,463.94],["very",463.94,464.22],["helpful",464.22,464.64],["for",464.64,464.9],["the",464.9,465.0],["reader.",465.0,465.26]]},{"start":465.84,"end":471.46,"text":"Another thing that helps the reader is the way he uses words and phrases to connect ideas.","words":[["Another",465.84,466.3],["thing",466.3,466.64],["that",466.64,466.8],["helps",466.8,467.04],["the",467.04,467.24],["reader",467.24,467.52],["is",467.52,467.94],["the",467.94,468.14],["way",468.14,468.32],["he",468.32,468.56],["uses",468.56,468.96],["words",468.96,469.48],["and",469.48,469.72],["phrases",469.72,470.2],["to",470.2,470.56],["connect",470.56,470.96],["ideas.",470.96,471.46]]},{"start":472.04,"end":475.16,"text":"You mean things like, however, and on the other hand?","words":[["You",472.04,472.24],["mean",472.24,472.4],["things",472.4,472.62],["like,",472.62,472.86],["however,",473.2,473.6],["and",473.98,474.2],["on",474.2,474.64],["the",474.64,474.76],["other",474.76,474.88],["hand?",474.88,475.16]]},{"start":475.26,"end":478.78,"text":"Yes. And finally, in addition...","words":[["Yes.",475.26,475.56],["And",476.12,476.56],["finally,",476.56,477.16],["in",477.68,477.78],["addition...",477.78,478.78]]},{"start":478.78,"end":481.88,"text":"Yes. That really is one of the hallmarks of a good essay.","words":[["Yes.",478.78,479.08],["That",479.46,479.7],["really",479.7,480.0],["is",480.0,480.18],["one",480.18,480.32],["of",480.32,480.42],["the",480.42,480.52],["hallmarks",480.52,481.0],["of",481.0,481.22],["a",481.22,481.32],["good",481.32,481.52],["essay.",481.52,481.88]]},{"start":481.88,"end":486.32,"text":"The content is the most important thing, of course, but there's no doubt that language","words":[["The",481.88,482.76],["content",482.76,483.16],["is",483.16,483.38],["the",483.38,483.48],["most",483.48,483.66],["important",483.66,484.04],["thing,",484.04,484.26],["of",484.32,484.4],["course,",484.4,484.62],["but",484.94,485.2],["there's",485.2,485.36],["no",485.36,485.56],["doubt",485.56,485.8],["that",485.8,485.94],["language",485.94,486.32]]},{"start":486.32,"end":489.62,"text":"can make the content clearer or otherwise for the reader.","words":[["can",486.32,486.62],["make",486.62,486.8],["the",486.8,486.92],["content",486.92,487.28],["clearer",487.28,487.7],["or",487.7,488.28],["otherwise",488.28,488.88],["for",488.88,489.26],["the",489.26,489.36],["reader.",489.36,489.62]]},{"start":490.28,"end":495.84,"text":"Now, you may feel at this early stage that your writing skills rusty, but reading is","words":[["Now,",490.28,490.76],["you",491.06,491.26],["may",491.26,491.44],["feel",491.44,491.72],["at",491.72,491.86],["this",491.86,492.0],["early",492.0,492.32],["stage",492.32,492.74],["that",492.74,492.98],["your",492.98,493.08],["writing",493.08,493.36],["skills",493.36,493.74],["rusty,",493.74,494.24],["but",494.62,495.06],["reading",495.06,495.46],["is",495.46,495.84]]},{"start":495.84,"end":496.58,"text":"the key, I think.","words":[["the",495.84,495.96],["key,",495.96,496.22],["I",496.3,496.42],["think.",496.42,496.58]]},{"start":497.24,"end":501.64,"text":"As you read more and more extensively, you'll find that your own use of academic language","words":[["As",497.24,497.48],["you",497.48,497.6],["read",497.6,497.78],["more",497.78,498.06],["and",498.06,498.2],["more",498.2,498.34],["extensively,",498.34,498.9],["you'll",499.44,499.58],["find",499.58,499.8],["that",499.8,499.96],["your",499.96,500.1],["own",500.1,500.3],["use",500.3,500.6],["of",500.6,500.78],["academic",500.78,501.12],["language",501.12,501.64]]},{"start":501.64,"end":504.54,"text":"will improve, and it'll get much easier to form your own.","words":[["will",501.64,501.84],["improve,",501.84,502.3],["and",502.64,502.8],["it'll",502.8,502.98],["get",502.98,503.12],["much",503.12,503.34],["easier",503.34,503.74],["to",503.74,503.9],["form",503.9,504.16],["your",504.16,504.3],["own.",504.3,504.54]]},{"start":508.2,"end":510.3,"text":"That is the end of section three.","words":[["That",508.2,508.68],["is",508.68,508.84],["the",508.84,509.0],["end",509.0,509.36],["of",509.36,509.56],["section",509.56,509.78],["three.",509.78,510.3]]},{"start":510.3,"end":513.66,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",510.3,511.26],["now",511.26,511.54],["have",511.54,511.9],["half",511.9,512.16],["a",512.16,512.34],["minute",512.34,512.56],["to",512.56,512.84],["check",512.84,513.12],["your",513.12,513.3],["answers.",513.3,513.66]]}]}